<section class="hero hero-page" style="background-image:url(images/dining-hall-2.webp)"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><h1>About Garahean Diners</h1><p>Home-style Filipino food, a warm welcome and a table for everyone.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap grid g2"><div><p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p><h2>Lutong bahay, every single day</h2><p>Garahean Diners is a casual diner on Nueva Street, Brgy. 11, Bacolod City. We cook the dishes Filipino families love, from bistek and menudo to crispy lechon kawali, pancit and lumpia, and lay them out fresh each morning so you can pick your favourites.</p><p>Our spacious, airy dining hall is made for long lunches with family and friends, and our affordable mixed fruits cups have become a local favourite.</p></div>
<img class="media h560" src="images/logo-mural.webp" alt="The Garahean Diners chef mural" loading="lazy"></div></section>
<section class="sec darkbg" style="padding:90px 0"><div class="wrap grid g4"><div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-fire"></i><h3>Cooked fresh daily</h3><p>A new menu every day, prepared in our own kitchen.</p></div><div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart"></i><h3>Affordable</h3><p>Generous servings at friendly prices.</p></div><div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-users"></i><h3>Big tables, big groups</h3><p>Room for families, barkada and company events.</p></div><div class="feature"><i class="fas fa-shopping-bag"></i><h3>Pickup &amp; trays</h3><p>Order ahead for pickup, food trays and packed meals.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="sec" id="events"><div class="wrap"><div class="center intro"><p class="eyebrow">Events &amp; catering</p><h2>Parties, trays and packed meals</h2><p>Planning a celebration or feeding a team? We prepare party trays and packed meals and can host your group in our dining hall. Message us with your date, headcount and favourite dishes.</p></div>
<div class="grid g3"><img class="media h320" src="images/christmas-banner.webp" alt="Garahean Diners Christmas celebration" loading="lazy"><img class="media h320" src="images/packed-meals.webp" alt="Packed meals" loading="lazy"><img class="media h320" src="images/buffet-trays-2.webp" alt="Party trays" loading="lazy"></div></div></section><section class="cta"><div class="wrap grid"><div><h2>Hungry? Drop by or order for pickup.</h2><p>Visit us at Nueva Street, Brgy. 11, Bacolod City, Philippines 6100, or call <strong>0947 199 6525</strong> to reserve your favourites.</p></div>
